/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/026.md:45:## 2. 面积让路的对角列车
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/026.md:46:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/026.md:47:- tags:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/026.md:48:  - operation:印章覆盖, stamp
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/026.md:49:  - operation:裁剪, clip
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/026.md:50:  - object:实心矩形, solid_rect
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/026.md:51:  - relation:对角偏移重复, diag_offset_repeat
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/026.md:52:  - relation:轨迹互相遮挡, trajectory_mutual_occlusion
