/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/028.md:115:## 4. 熔断闸门
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/028.md:116:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/028.md:117:- 参考题目题号:8(2b83f449)、4(f0100645)、19(d35bdbdc)
