/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/028.md:186:## 6. 标记行引力带
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/028.md:187:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/028.md:188:- 参考题目题号:9(0f63c0b9)、4(f0100645)、14(d6e50e54)
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/028.md:189:- tags:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/028.md:190:  - operation:滑动, slide
