/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/012.md:87:  - relation:跨尺度自指, cross_scale_self_reference
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/012.md:88:  - condition:反相编码宏图, invert_encodes_macro
