/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/012.md:117:  - operation:循环移色, color_cycle
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/012.md:118:  - object:边缘源像素, edge_source_pixel
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/012.md:119:  - object:调色板段, palette_run
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/012.md:120:  - object:转向像素, turn_pixel
