/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/016.md:50:  - operation:擦除, erase
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/016.md:51:  - object:实心矩形, solid_rectangle
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/016.md:52:  - object:凸耳, tab
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/016.md:53:  - relation:逐步平移, stepwise_translation
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/016.md:54:  - condition:凸耳决定方向, tab_determines_direction
