/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/008.md:43:## 2. 遮挡链重建实心堆叠
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/008.md:44:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/008.md:45:- 参考题目题号: 2 (c920a713)、14 (445eab21)、1 (5833af48)
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/008.md:46:- tags:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/008.md:47:  - operation:排序, sort
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/008.md:48:  - operation:重绘, redraw
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/008.md:49:  - operation:填充, fill
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/008.md:50:  - object:矩形边框, rect_frame
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/008.md:51:  - object:实心矩形, solid_rect
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/008.md:52:  - relation:遮挡顺序, occlusion_order
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/008.md:53:  - relation:传递闭包, transitive_closure
