/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/027.md:221:## 7. 隐式镜轴与反射类型颜色编码
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/027.md:222:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/027.md:223:- 参考题目题号: 6, 15
