/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/039.md:160:## 5. 残迹续铺
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/039.md:161:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/039.md:162:- tags:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/039.md:163:  - operation:图案印章, stamp
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/039.md:164:  - operation:平铺, tile
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/039.md:165:  - operation:对称补全, symmetric_complete
