/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/039.md:175:### docstring
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/039.md:176:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/039.md:177:```text
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/039.md:178:把与精灵体前缘吻合且相位整除的一线残迹,识别为未画完的平铺链的末节,续印补全整条链。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/039.md:179:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/039.md:180:输入结构:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/039.md:181:- 黑色背景上散布若干小的单色矩形包络精灵体(内部有固定图案,宽高
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/039.md:182:  均大于 1),以及若干条 1 像素宽的同色短线段(残迹)。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/039.md:183:- 有的残迹与某个精灵体处于同一行带(或列带),有的残迹只是孤立
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/039.md:184:  干扰;残迹本身看不出属于哪种结构。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/039.md:185:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/039.md:186:规则:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/039.md:187:- 对每个精灵体,沿其行带向左右(或列带向上下)寻找同色残迹;
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/039.md:188:  残迹须与该精灵体面向它的那一列(或那一行)边缘图案完全相同,
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/039.md:189:  才是它的候选残迹。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/039.md:190:- 设精灵体沿该方向尺寸为 s,残迹到精灵体同侧边缘的位移为 d;
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/039.md:191:  仅当 d 是 s 的整数倍 (d = m*s) 时,残迹被认定为无缝平铺链第
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/039.md:192:  m+1 节的前缘:在偏移 s, 2s, ..., m*s 处依次印整个精灵体,
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/039.md:193:  第 m*s 处的整印恰好覆盖并补全残迹。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/039.md:194:- 形状与前缘不符的残迹、以及相位除不尽的残迹一律原样保留;
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/039.md:195:  没有合法残迹的精灵体不动。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/039.md:196:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/039.md:197:关键洞察:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/039.md:198:- 那条 1 像素线不是独立对象,而是一条从未画完的周期链留下的
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/039.md:199:  前缘残迹;它同时要通过"形状吻合"与"相位整除"两道检验,失败者
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/039.md:200:  全是陷阱,成功者要求把整条链连同残迹本身一起补成完整周期。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/039.md:201:```
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/039.md:202:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/039.md:203:## 6. 镜面双板修复
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/039.md:204:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/039.md:205:- tags:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/039.md:206:  - operation:对称补全, symmetric_complete
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/039.md:207:  - operation:擦除, erase
