/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/048.md:57:### docstring
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/048.md:58:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/048.md:59:```text
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/048.md:60:把分隔区域按主色降采样为粗网格,再依反对角线等值与对角色序的周期性补出全部空缺。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/048.md:61:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/048.md:62:输入结构
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/048.md:63:- 整行整列的黑色分隔线把网格划成 R×C 个矩形区域;
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/048.md:64:- 非空区域内散布一种"主色"像素,并混有少量另一种颜色的杂点
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/048.md:65:  (杂点颜色各区域不一,像素个数与摆放随意);
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/048.md:66:- 若干区域完全为空;以主色降采样得到的 R×C 色矩阵沿每条反对角线
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/048.md:67:  (行号+列号相等)同色;
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/048.md:68:- 大多数反对角线上至少有一个非空区域,但恰有一整条反对角线的区域全部为空;
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/048.md:69:- 按反对角线序号排列的颜色序列是一个周期序列。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/048.md:70:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/048.md:71:规则
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/048.md:72:- 取每个非空区域的多数色(主色),把区域折叠为一格,得到部分可见的
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/048.md:73:  R×C 色矩阵;
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/048.md:74:- 所在反对角线上尚有可见颜色的空格,取该反对角线的唯一颜色;
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/048.md:75:- 整条为空的那条反对角线,其颜色由对角色序的周期规律延拓得到;
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/048.md:76:- 输出为补全后的 R×C 网格。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/048.md:77:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/048.md:78:关键洞察
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/048.md:79:- 规律在粗尺度而非像素尺度,像素级怎么补都对不上;杂点与像素个数是诱饵;
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/048.md:80:- 仅靠反对角等值仍差一步:必须再发现"反对角线颜色随序号周期变化"这层规律,
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/048.md:81:  才能恢复整条缺失的对角线。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/048.md:82:```
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/048.md:83:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/048.md:84:## 3. 反射链光路
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/048.md:85:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/048.md:86:- 参考题目题号: `19 (e39e9282)`, `12 (d968ffd4)`, `8 (9c1e755f)`
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/048.md:87:- tags:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/048.md:88:  - operation:射线延伸, ray_extend
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/048.md:89:  - operation:反射, reflect
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/048.md:90:  - object:实心方块, solid_square
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/048.md:91:  - object:光源像素, source_pixel
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/048.md:92:  - relation:链式传播, chained_propagation
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/048.md:93:  - condition:颜色决定光学行为, color_det_optics
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/048.md:94:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/048.md:95:### docstring
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/048.md:96:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/048.md:97:```text
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/048.md:98:边缘光源发出的光线依次被粉色方块横向错位反射、被灰色方块吸收,输出每条光线的终点。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/048.md:99:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/048.md:100:输入结构
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/048.md:101:- 黑背景上散布若干实心正方形块:粉色为反射镜,灰色为吸收体,
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/048.md:102:  边长均为奇数且可以不同,摆放位置高低不一;
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/048.md:103:- 网格边缘有一个或多个栗色光源像素。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/048.md:104:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/048.md:105:规则
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/048.md:106:- 每个光源沿其所在行(源位于左右边缘)或所在列(源位于上下边缘)直线传播;
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/048.md:107:- 传播途中依次结算与路径相交的方块:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/048.md:108:  - 经过粉色方块后,光线的行号(或列号)关于该方块的中心行(列)做镜像,
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/048.md:109:    随后从方块另一侧继续同向传播;
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/048.md:110:  - 撞上灰色方块则终止,在被撞面外侧紧邻的背景格染栗色;
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/048.md:111:- 路径若不再与任何方块相交,则在对侧边缘格染栗色;
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/048.md:112:- 方块与光线路径不相交时对光线没有任何影响;
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/048.md:113:- 输出=输入网格加上每条光线的终点栗色像素,光源保留。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/048.md:114:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/048.md:115:关键洞察
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/048.md:116:- 方块不是目标物而是光学元件;每次关于不同中心的镜像都会改变后续
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/048.md:117:  会命中哪些方块,必须按顺序追踪整条因果链;
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/048.md:118:- 关于不同中心的反射不满足交换律,复合结果不可约化为简单的奇偶计数。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/048.md:119:```
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/048.md:120:
