/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/011.md:8:## 1. 缺角矩形的层序复原
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/011.md:9:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/011.md:10:- 参考题目: `4290ef0e`, `b6afb2da`, `8a6d367c`
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/011.md:11:- tags:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/011.md:12:  - operation:补全, complete
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/011.md:13:  - operation:填充, fill
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/011.md:14:  - object:角点生成元, corner_generator
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/011.md:15:  - object:实心矩形, solid_rectangle
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/011.md:16:  - relation:包含, containment
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/011.md:17:  - relation:覆盖层序, occlusion_order
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/011.md:18:  - condition:缺角定层序, missing_corner_orders_layers
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/011.md:19:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/011.md:20:### docstring
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/011.md:21:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/011.md:22:```text
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/011.md:23:由散落的同色角点重建从未画出的重叠矩形，并按“缺角者居下”的侵入关系恢复覆盖层序。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/011.md:24:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/011.md:25:输入结构
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/011.md:26:- 黑色背景上散布若干组彩色像素，每组同色，是一个轴对齐实心矩形
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/011.md:27: （长宽均不小于 3）的角点。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/011.md:28:- 每组给出全部四个角，或恰好缺失一个角；缺失的角的位置必然落在
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/011.md:29:  另一组所定义矩形的内部。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/011.md:30:- 相互重叠的矩形之间的上下关系，均可由“谁的缺角落在谁的体内”
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/011.md:31:  经传递闭包唯一确定。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/011.md:32:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/011.md:33:规则
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/011.md:34:- 由每组角点重建其轴对齐矩形；三个角可唯一确定第四个角。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/011.md:35:- 若 A 组缺失的角位于 B 组矩形区域内，则判定 B 覆盖 A。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/011.md:36:- 在输出中按层序自底向上绘制所有实心矩形，后画者覆盖先画者；
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/011.md:37:  与他者不重叠的矩形绘制次序不影响结果。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/011.md:38:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/011.md:39:关键洞察
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/011.md:40:- 矩形从未被画出，画面上只有角点生成元；缺失的角不是缺陷而是
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/011.md:41:  残迹——它被上层矩形“吃掉”，恰好编码了整叠矩形的覆盖顺序。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/011.md:42:```
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/011.md:43:
