/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/011.md:85:## 3. 带假指针的色标链
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/011.md:86:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/011.md:87:- 参考题目: `668eec9a`, `891232d6`, `505fff84`
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/011.md:88:- tags:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/011.md:89:  - operation:排序, sorting
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/011.md:90:  - operation:压缩, compress
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/011.md:91:  - object:线段对象, line_object
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/011.md:92:  - object:端点色标, endpoint_color_tag
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/011.md:93:  - object:色条行, color_stripe_row
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/011.md:94:  - relation:颜色指针链, color_pointer_chain
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/011.md:95:  - condition:有出边无入边者为链头, out_edge_no_in_edge_head
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/011.md:96:  - condition:回边假指针, back_edge_fake_pointer
