/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/011.md:126:## 4. 消失的推者
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/011.md:127:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/011.md:128:- 参考题目: `9f669b64`, `8b9c3697`, `6f8cd79b`
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/011.md:129:- tags:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/011.md:130:  - operation:平移, translate
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/011.md:131:  - operation:补全, complete
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/011.md:132:  - operation:反演复原, inverse_restore
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/011.md:133:  - object:分裂栅条, split_bar
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/011.md:134:  - object:漆痕, paint_residue
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/011.md:135:  - object:画布边界, canvas_boundary
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/011.md:136:  - relation:残迹反推, residue_backtracking
