/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/030.md:8:## 1. 沉底直线的抽除
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/030.md:9:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/030.md:10:- tags:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/030.md:11:  - operation:层序推断, infer_layer_order
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/030.md:12:  - operation:平铺补全, periodic_restore
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/030.md:13:  - object:全幅直线, full_span_line
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/030.md:14:  - object:周期底纹, periodic_lattice
