/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/030.md:41:## 2. 孔洞指针链
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/030.md:42:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/030.md:43:- tags:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/030.md:44:  - operation:重涂色, recolor
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/030.md:45:  - operation:链式追踪, chain_follow
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/030.md:46:  - object:瓦片阵列, tile_array
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/030.md:47:  - object:位置孔洞, position_hole
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/030.md:48:  - relation:坐标指针, coordinate_pointer
