/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/041.md:6:## 1. 门径传送管
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/041.md:7:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/041.md:8:- tags:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/041.md:9:  - operation:射线延伸, ray_extend
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/041.md:10:  - operation:重涂色, recolor
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/041.md:11:  - operation:链式传递, chain_relay
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/041.md:12:  - object:缺口矩形框, gapped_rect_frame
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/041.md:13:  - object:标记像素, marker_pixel
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/041.md:14:  - relation:缺口定向, gap_determines_direction
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/041.md:15:  - condition:穿越即染色, transit_recolors
