/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/041.md:102:## 4. 色带即笔程
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/041.md:103:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/041.md:104:- tags:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/041.md:105:  - operation:压缩, compress
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/041.md:106:  - operation:展开, unfold
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/041.md:107:  - operation:连线, draw_line
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/041.md:108:  - object:色带, color_band
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/041.md:109:  - object:螺线, spiral
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/041.md:110:  - relation:空间排列顺序, spatial_order
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/041.md:111:  - condition:厚度即步长, thickness_is_step_length
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/041.md:112:- 参考题目题号: 5, 11, 12
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/041.md:113:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/041.md:114:### docstring
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/041.md:115:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/041.md:116:```text
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/041.md:117:把锯齿色带序列读成一串（颜色，厚度）指令，在新画布上按顺时针螺线逐段执行画出。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/041.md:118:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/041.md:119:输入结构：
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/041.md:120:- 输入网格被少数几种颜色完全覆盖，没有独立背景。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/041.md:121:- 沿某一条轴（行向或列向，需自行判定），逐线多数色构成若干条连续色带；带与带的边界参差不齐，属于噪声。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/041.md:122:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/041.md:123:规则：
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/041.md:124:- 沿正确的轴做逐线多数色压缩，得到有序的色带序列，并记录每条带占据的线数作为该带厚度。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/041.md:125:- 在黑底画布上从左上角起笔向右画第一段：颜色取第一条带的颜色，长度为其厚度。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/041.md:126:- 之后每一段顺时针转九十度接着画：下一段的第一格是上一段末格沿新方向的相邻格，颜色与长度取自下一条带，直到带用完。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/041.md:127:- 画布尺寸恰好是整条螺线的包围盒。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/041.md:128:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/041.md:129:关键洞察：
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/041.md:130:- 色带不是要摘要成一行像素的排序结果，而是一份海龟绘图程序：压缩得到指令流，输出是这段程序的执行轨迹，带的厚度从"占多宽"变成了"走多远"。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/041.md:131:```
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/041.md:132:
