/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/041.md:260:  - operation:镜像, mirror
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/041.md:261:  - object:轴像素, pivot_pixel
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/041.md:262:  - object:像素段, pixel_segment
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/041.md:263:  - relation:全局唯一色定轴, global_singleton_sets_pivot
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/041.md:264:  - condition:无轴整行翻转, pivotless_row_full_reverse
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/041.md:265:- 参考题目题号: 2, 12, 14
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/041.md:266:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/041.md:267:### docstring
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/041.md:268:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/041.md:269:```text
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/041.md:270:以全网格中仅出现一次的颜色像素为各自所在行的转轴，轴两侧的段各自独立翻转；没有轴的行整行翻转。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/041.md:271:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/041.md:272:输入结构：
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/041.md:273:- 网格被彩色像素铺满，没有背景。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/041.md:274:- 有若干种颜色在整个网格中恰好只出现一次，这些孤色像素分布在互不相同的行上，位置不连成直线。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/041.md:275:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/041.md:276:规则：
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/041.md:277:- 找出全网格中出现次数为一的颜色，其像素是所在行的转轴。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/041.md:278:- 含转轴的行：轴像素保持原位，轴左侧的段整体左右翻转，轴右侧的段整体左右翻转，两段互不越过轴。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/041.md:279:- 不含转轴的行：整行左右翻转。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/041.md:280:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/041.md:281:关键洞察：
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/041.md:282:- 支点不靠位置、颜色名或任何画出来的记号标示，而靠"全图唯一"这一统计特征；且两侧独立翻转不同于绕轴的整行反转，只有轴恰好居中时二者才碰巧一致——这正是最容易被首个示例带偏的地方。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/041.md:283:```
