/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/014.md:95:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/014.md:96:```text
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/014.md:97:把所有残缺副本按锚点对齐取并集重建出从未画出的完整模板，再据此补全每个副本。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/014.md:98:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/014.md:99:输入结构
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/014.md:100:- 黑色背景上散布同一多色精灵的若干残缺副本，朝向一致、不旋转不镜像；
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/014.md:101:- 每个副本都缺了一部分像素，且各副本缺失的部位互不相同，
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/014.md:102:  没有任何一个副本是完整的；
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/014.md:103:- 每个副本都保留有精灵固定位置上的一个红色锚点像素，用于对齐；
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/014.md:104:- 并集中同一相对位置的颜色在各副本间一致。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/014.md:105:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/014.md:106:规则
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/014.md:107:- 以红色锚点为原点对齐叠加全部副本，取像素并集，重建出完整模板；
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/014.md:108:- 把每个副本按模板补全：副本原有像素保持原色，
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/014.md:109:  新补上的像素一律涂成黄色；
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/014.md:110:- 背景与锚点保持不变。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/014.md:111:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/014.md:112:关键洞察
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/014.md:113:- 完整模板从未出现在画面上，任何单个副本都不足以定义形状，
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/014.md:114:  它只能由全部残迹对齐后众筹并集重建；
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/014.md:115:- 黄色不是模板的一部分，而是"本次补上"的痕迹标记。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/014.md:116:```
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/014.md:117:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/014.md:118:## 4. 指针链定序拼接
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/014.md:119:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/014.md:120:- tags:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/014.md:121:  - operation:裁剪, crop
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/014.md:122:  - operation:拼接, concatenate
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/014.md:123:  - object:瓦片, tile
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/014.md:124:  - object:指针像素, pointer_pixel
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/014.md:125:  - relation:指针击中定后继, pointer_hits_successor
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/014.md:126:  - condition:无人指向者为链头, unpointed_head
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/014.md:127:- 参考题目: 6 (409aa875)、2 (28bf18c6)、4 (dc2aa30b)
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/014.md:128:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/014.md:129:### docstring
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/014.md:130:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/014.md:131:```text
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/014.md:132:沿瓦片边缘指针像素的指向串出一条唯一的链，把瓦片图案按链序水平拼接输出。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/014.md:133:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/014.md:134:输入结构
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/014.md:135:- 黑色背景上零散摆放若干块同尺寸的正方形瓦片，互不接触、位置无规律；
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/014.md:136:- 每块瓦片以自身底色填满并画有内部图案；
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/014.md:137:- 每块瓦片某条边的中点处有一个指针像素，颜色在所有瓦片上统一，
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/014.md:138:  且不出现在任何图案中。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/014.md:139:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/014.md:140:规则
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/014.md:141:- 每个指针像素沿其所在边的外法线方向发出一条看不见的射线，
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/014.md:142:  射线首先击中的那块瓦片就是当前瓦片的后继；
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/014.md:143:- 链头是唯一没有被任何射线击中的瓦片；
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/014.md:144:- 从链头沿后继关系走完全部瓦片，把每块瓦片的指针像素恢复为该瓦片底色后，
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/014.md:145:  按链序从左到右水平拼接成一行输出。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/014.md:146:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/014.md:147:关键洞察
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/014.md:148:- 瓦片在画布上的摆放位置与阅读顺序无关，顺序藏在指针的击中关系里；
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/014.md:149:- 必须先找到"无人指向"的链头，从任何别的瓦片出发都会得到错误的拼接次序。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/014.md:150:```
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/014.md:151:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/014.md:152:## 5. 标记块三重指令
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/014.md:153:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/014.md:154:- tags:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/014.md:155:  - operation:印章覆盖, stamp
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/014.md:156:  - operation:缩放, scaling
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/014.md:157:  - operation:重涂色, recolor
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/014.md:158:  - operation:擦除, erase
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/014.md:159:  - object:锚点像素, anchor_pixel
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/014.md:160:  - object:方块标记, block_marker
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/014.md:161:  - relation:相对坐标复制, relative_coord_copy
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/014.md:162:  - condition:标记边长即倍数, marker_size_is_scale
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/014.md:163:- 参考题目: 7 (f5c89df1)、5 (57aa92db)
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/014.md:164:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/014.md:165:### docstring
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/014.md:166:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/014.md:167:```text
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/014.md:168:以锚点为原点记录源图形，在每个方块标记处按标记边长放大、按标记颜色重涂后盖章。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/014.md:169:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/014.md:170:输入结构
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/014.md:171:- 背景上有一个单色多像素的源图形，旁边紧贴一个异色单像素锚点，
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/014.md:172:  它是与源色四邻接触最多的孤立点；
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/014.md:173:- 画布其余位置散布若干实心正方形标记块，边长为一格、两格或三格不等，
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/014.md:174:  颜色各异且都不同于源色与锚点色。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/014.md:175:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/014.md:176:规则
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/014.md:177:- 记录源图形每个像素相对锚点的坐标；
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/014.md:178:- 对每个边长为 k 的标记块：以其左上角为新原点，把每个相对坐标乘以 k，
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/014.md:179:  在对应位置画一个 k×k 的实心小方块，颜色用该标记块自己的颜色；
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/014.md:180:- 最后擦除源图形、锚点与所有标记块本体，只留下各个放大副本。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/014.md:181:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/014.md:182:关键洞察
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/014.md:183:- 一个标记块同时编码三条指令：位置是贴章原点、边长是缩放倍数、
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/014.md:184:  颜色是重涂色；
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/014.md:185:- 只把标记当位置用会漏掉尺寸差异——输出的各副本大小并不相同。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/014.md:186:```
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/014.md:187:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/014.md:188:## 6. 深度循环调色
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/014.md:189:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/014.md:190:- tags:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/014.md:191:  - operation:重涂色, recolor
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/014.md:192:  - object:图例竖条, legend_bar
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/014.md:193:  - object:实心斑块, solid_blob
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/014.md:194:  - relation:腐蚀深度索引, erosion_depth_index
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/014.md:195:  - condition:颜色随深度循环, depth_color_cycle
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/014.md:196:- 参考题目: 12 (09c534e7)、20 (e4888269)、19 (a5313dff)
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/014.md:197:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/014.md:198:### docstring
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/014.md:199:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/014.md:200:```text
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/014.md:201:按像素在斑块内的层深给它上色，颜色从图例竖条自上而下循环取用。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/014.md:202:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/014.md:203:输入结构
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/014.md:204:- 画布一角有一根竖直单列图例条，自上而下由 k 种不同颜色各占一格；
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/014.md:205:- 其余是黑色背景上的若干灰色实心斑块，形状各异；
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/014.md:206:- 至少有一个斑块的最大层深超过 k。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/014.md:207:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/014.md:208:规则
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/014.md:209:- 对每个斑块像素求层深：与背景四邻相接的像素层深为一，
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/014.md:210:  向内逐层剥洋葱依次加一；
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/014.md:211:- 层深为 d 的像素涂成图例条自上而下第 ((d-1) mod k)+1 行的颜色，
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/014.md:212:  即层深超过 k 后颜色从图例顶端重新循环；
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/014.md:213:- 图例条与背景保持不变。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/014.md:214:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/014.md:215:关键洞察
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/014.md:216:- 图例不是颜色替换表，而是按深度索引的调色板，
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/014.md:217:  像素输出色只由它在斑块内的层数决定，与斑块原色无关；
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/014.md:218:- 斑块足够厚时色带会循环重复——只看外几层会误以为
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/014.md:219:  颜色到第 k 层就停住了。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/014.md:220:```
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/014.md:221:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/014.md:222:## 7. 残迹复原周期格
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/014.md:223:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/014.md:224:- tags:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/014.md:225:  - operation:补全, completion
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/014.md:226:  - object:线段残迹, line_fragment
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/014.md:227:  - object:角标记, corner_marker
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/014.md:228:  - object:周期网格, periodic_grid
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/014.md:229:  - relation:间距推周期, spacing_infers_period
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/014.md:230:  - condition:仅标记框内补全, fill_inside_markers_only
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/014.md:231:- 参考题目: 1 (4612dd53)、15 (20981f0e)、8 (da6e95e5)
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/014.md:232:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/014.md:233:### docstring
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/014.md:234:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/014.md:235:```text
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/014.md:236:从零散线段残迹反推一张周期网格的周期与相位，只在四个角标记围成的矩形内把网格补全。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/014.md:237:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/014.md:238:输入结构
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/014.md:239:- 黑色背景上有四个绿色单像素角标记，构成一个轴对齐矩形的四个角；
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/014.md:240:- 画布各处（矩形内外都有）散落若干蓝色的横向与纵向短线段，
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/014.md:241:  它们都是同一张无限周期网格线（每隔固定行距一条横线、
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/014.md:242:  每隔固定列距一条竖线）残留下来的碎片；
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/014.md:243:- 碎片的间距与位置足以唯一确定两个周期和各自的相位。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/014.md:244:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/014.md:245:规则
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/014.md:246:- 由平行残迹所在行（列）之间的间距推出横线行距与竖线列距及相位；
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/014.md:247:- 在四个角标记围成的矩形内部按该周期与相位画出全部完整的
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/014.md:248:  蓝色横线与竖线；
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/014.md:249:- 矩形外的残迹保持原样，不延长也不擦除；角标记保持不变。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/014.md:250:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/014.md:251:关键洞察
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/014.md:252:- 完整网格从未在画面上出现，能看到的只有它的碎片，
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/014.md:253:  周期与相位必须由碎片之间的对齐关系反推；
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/014.md:254:- 补全的范围由角标记而不是碎片分布决定——矩形外的碎片是诱饵，
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/014.md:255:  不需要也不允许续画。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/014.md:256:```
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/014.md:257:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/014.md:258:## 8. 真线守门的瓦片排序
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/014.md:259:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/014.md:260:- tags:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/014.md:261:  - operation:排序, sorting
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/014.md:262:  - operation:计数, counting
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/014.md:263:  - operation:补全, completion
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/014.md:264:  - object:残缺格线, broken_grid_line
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/014.md:265:  - object:瓦片, tile
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/014.md:266:  - relation:相邻成对标真线, adjacent_pair_marks_line
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/014.md:267:  - condition:按前景数升序重排, ascending_by_count
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/014.md:268:- 参考题目: 1 (4612dd53)、4 (dc2aa30b)、18 (85b81ff1)
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/014.md:269:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/014.md:270:### docstring
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/014.md:271:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/014.md:272:```text
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/014.md:273:先用"相邻成对才算真线"识别出真正的分隔行列，再把瓦片按内部黄点数升序重排并补全格线。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/014.md:274:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/014.md:275:输入结构
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/014.md:276:- 画布上蓝色像素构成一张残缺网格：真正的分隔行在该行内至少有一对
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/014.md:277:  水平相邻的蓝像素，真正的分隔列在该列内至少有一对垂直相邻的蓝像素；
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/014.md:278:- 另有一些孤立蓝点落在假行假列上充当干扰，会诱导错误的划分；
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/014.md:279:- 真分隔行列把画布划分成矩形瓦片阵列，每块瓦片内散布若干黄色像素，
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/014.md:280:  各瓦片的黄点数量互不相同。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/014.md:281:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/014.md:282:规则
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/014.md:283:- 先按相邻成对判据确定真分隔行与真分隔列，得到瓦片划分；
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/014.md:284:- 数出每块瓦片内的黄色像素数，把瓦片内容整体按数量升序
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/014.md:285:  从左上角起按行主序重新放入各瓦片槽位；
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/014.md:286:- 输出中所有真分隔行列画成完整的蓝色实线，孤立的假线蓝点全部清除。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/014.md:287:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/014.md:288:关键洞察
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/014.md:289:- 排序之前必须先回答"哪些线是真的"：孤立蓝点会诱导按等距
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/014.md:290:  或假线切块，得到完全错误的瓦片单元；
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/014.md:291:- 重排的对象是由真线定义的瓦片，格线补全与假点清除只是收尾。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/014.md:292:```
