/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/002.md:46:  - object:灰色残影, gray_silhouette
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/002.md:47:  - operation:模板匹配, template_matching
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/002.md:48:  - relation:二面体变换, dihedral_transformation
