/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/037.md:8:## 1. 依长度顺序下落的横条
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/037.md:9:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/037.md:10:- tags:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/037.md:11:  - operation:重力下落, gravity_drop
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/037.md:12:  - operation:排序, sorting
