/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/038.md:117:  - object:标记像素, marker_pixel
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/038.md:118:  - relation:嵌入标记定向, embedded_marker_steers
