/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/038.md:185:  - object:端帽像素, cap_pixel
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/038.md:186:  - object:正方形区域, square_region
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/038.md:187:  - relation:指针链定序, pointer_chain_order
