/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/033.md:6:## 1. 扫掠奇偶消除
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/033.md:7:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/033.md:8:- 参考题号: 14, 6
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/033.md:9:- tags:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/033.md:10:  - operation:滑动, slide
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/033.md:11:  - operation:奇偶合成, parity_compositing
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/033.md:12:  - object:贴边矩形, edge_rectangle
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/033.md:13:  - object:轨迹条带, trail_stripe
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/033.md:14:  - relation:对称差, symmetric_difference
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/033.md:15:  - condition:奇数次覆盖着色, odd_coverage_colored
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/033.md:16:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/033.md:17:### docstring
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/033.md:18:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/033.md:19:```text
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/033.md:20:让所有贴边黑色矩形同时滑向对侧边缘，只有被扫掠条带覆盖奇数次的格子染橙，偶数次的格子保持背景，最后盖上终点黑矩形。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/033.md:21:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/033.md:22:输入结构
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/033.md:23:- 网格有统一背景色，其上分布若干黑色实心矩形，每个矩形恰好贴住一条外边缘。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/033.md:24:- 贴上、下边缘的矩形沿其所在列带滑向对侧；贴左、右边缘的矩形沿其所在行带滑向对侧。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/033.md:25:- 橙色与黑色是保留色，不作为背景或装饰出现。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/033.md:26:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/033.md:27:规则
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/033.md:28:- 每个矩形从起始位置滑到对侧边缘，扫过一条从起点到终点的完整行带或列带（含起止区域）。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/033.md:29:- 统计每个格子被多少条扫掠条带覆盖：奇数次的格子染橙，偶数次（含零次）的格子为背景。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/033.md:30:- 最后把每个矩形以黑色盖在其对侧终点位置，压在轨迹之上。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/033.md:31:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/033.md:32:关键洞察
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/033.md:33:- 轨迹的合成不是并集而是对称差：十字交叉区与平行重叠区两两抵消，画面上出现"断掉的走廊"和被挖空的交叉口，先按并集理解的人会在重叠处全部出错。
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/033.md:34:```
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/033.md:35:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/033.md:36:## 2. 测地色环
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/033.md:37:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/033.md:38:- 参考题号: 3, 9, 13
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/033.md:39:- tags:
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/033.md:40:  - operation:寻路, pathfinding
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/des/fable/10/033.md:41:  - operation:同心层填充, concentric_fill
